2.3 PROXIMAL POLICY OPTIMIZATION (PPO) — PRIMARY METHOD
--------------------------------------------------------
Current state-of-the-art for optimal execution:

RL-Exec (Duflot & Robineau, 2025):
    - PPO agent on historical BTC-USD replays
    - Endogenous transient impact (resilience)
    - Partial fills, maker/taker fees, latency
    - Depth-20 LOB features + microstructure indicators
    - Sell-only inventory constraint
    - Strict time split: Jan-2020 train, Feb-2020 test
    - One-sided Wilcoxon signed-rank test with FDR correction
    - Bootstrap confidence intervals

Performance:
    - Significantly outperforms TWAP and VWAP
    - Advantage increases with execution horizon

